{"at":"2026-10-05T11:37:40.031Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"conclusion":"W3C IndexedDB 2.0规范证明布尔值不是合法索引键类型，禁止直接建boolean索引或where.equals(true)查询","content":"W3C Indexed Database API 2.0规范第2.4节定义：A key has an associated type which is one of: number, date, string, binary, or array. The following ECMAScript types are valid keys: Number primitive values (except NaN), Date objects, String primitive values, ArrayBuffer objects, Array objects. Attempting to convert other ECMAScript values to a key will fail. 布尔值（true/false）不是合法的可索引键类型，尝试转换为键将直接失败（抛出DataError）。","scope":"IndexedDB键类型与索引可行性","source":"https://www.w3.org/TR/IndexedDB-2/"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording evidence for IndexedDB key types","toolSummary":"Recording evidence for IndexedDB key types"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":112,"imagePath":null}
{"at":"2026-10-05T11:37:44.723Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"conclusion":"W3C Secure Contexts规范证明localhost与https为受信安全上下文，file://和任意未受信http无法作为合规生产运行安全上下文","content":"W3C Secure Contexts规范第3.1节定义：If origin's scheme is either 'https' or 'wss', return Potentially Trustworthy. If origin's host matches 127.0.0.0/8 or ::1/128, or localhost, return Potentially Trustworthy. ESM模块和Service Worker必须在安全上下文与标准HTTP/HTTPS源下运行，file://协议受同源策略和浏览器模块加载限制，不能免服务器直接双击运行ESM应用。","scope":"安全上下文与本地部署可行性","source":"https://www.w3.org/TR/secure-contexts/"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording evidence for Secure Contexts","toolSummary":"Recording evidence for Secure Contexts"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":114,"imagePath":null}
{"at":"2026-10-05T11:37:49.018Z","toolCall":{"args":{"Arguments":{"conclusion":"MDN规范证明persist()需安全上下文且由浏览器依规则授权，不能宣称100%零丢失或绝对持久化保证","content":"MDN StorageManager.persist文档指出：Secure context: This feature is available only in secure contexts (HTTPS). persist()返回Promise<boolean>，浏览器根据具体规则决定是否授予持久化。即使持久化，用户显式清理浏览器数据或无痕模式结束时仍会被清除；Safari在特定无交互条件下仍执行清理。系统必须依赖用户可控的显式JSON备份，不能承诺绝对零丢数据。","scope":"本地持久化与数据防丢边界","source":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/StorageManager/persist"},"ServerName":"project_architect","ToolName":"evidence_record","toolAction":"Recording evidence for StorageManager.persist","toolSummary":"Recording evidence for StorageManager.persist"},"name":"call_mcp_tool"},"decision":"allow","stepIdx":116,"imagePath":null}
